77200.sol:
Let $\mathrm{y}=\mathrm{f}(\mathrm{x}) \Rightarrow \frac{\mathrm{dy}}{\mathrm{dx}}=\mathrm{f}^1(\mathrm{x}) \Rightarrow \frac{\mathrm{dx}}{\mathrm{dy}}=\frac{1}{\mathrmf^{\prime}(\mathrm{x})}\begin{aligned}
& \frac{d^2 x}{d y^2}=\frac{\frac{-d}{d y} f^{\prime}(x)}{\left(f^{\prime}(x)\right)^2}...(i) \\
& \frac{\frac{-d}{d y} f^{\prime}(x)}{\left(f^{\prime}(x)\right)^2}=\frac{\frac{-d}{d y}\left(\frac{d y}{d x}\right) \cdot \frac{d x}{d x}}{\left(f^{\prime}(x)\right)^2}=\frac{\frac{-d}{d x}\left(f^{\prime}(x)\right) \cdot \frac{d x}{d y}}{\left(\frac{d y}{d x}\right)^2} \\
& \Rightarrow \frac{-f^{\prime}(x) \cdot \frac{d x}{d y}}{\left(\frac{d y}{d x}\right)^2}=\frac{-\left(\frac{d^2 y}{d x^2}\right)}{\left(\frac{d y}{d x}\right)^3}=\frac{-d^2 y}{d x^2}\left(\frac{d y}{d x}\right)^{-3}
\end{aligned}$
